@{
    Layout = null;

    var betTypeNames = ViewData["BetTypeNames"] as string[];
    var sportTypeNames = ViewData["SportTypeNames"] as string;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Max Payout Setting Information</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p>
        <strong>Max Payout Setting Information</strong>
        <br>
        <span>&nbsp;- Max Payout Per Match is a setting that controls the total max payout of all tickets of the same match.</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For example,</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. Given that max payout per match = 1,000</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. If member places the first ticket with Odds = 10, Stake = 70, the ticket will have:</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Max Bet = Max Payout Per Match / Odds = 1,000 / 10 = 100.</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Max Payout = Stake * Odds = 70 * 10 = 700 = <em>Accumulated Max Payout*</em></span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. If member places the second ticket with Odds = 5, the ticket will have:</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Max Bet = (Max Payout Per Match - Accumulated Max Payout) / Odds = (1,000 - 700) / 5 = 60.</span>
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0in">
        <em>
            <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * Accumulated Max Payout is the Max Payout of all tickets of the same match excludes the Void/Reject tickets. Therefore, if the first ticket is voided, Max Bet of the</span><br>
            <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; second ticket = (1,000 - 0)/5 = 200.</span>
        </em>
        <br>
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Saba Sports:</strong>
        <br>
        <span>&nbsp;- The Saba Futsal uses the bet settings of Saba Soccer.</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;- The Saba Cricket uses the bet settings of Other Sports.</span><br>
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top:6.0pt; margin-bottom:6.0pt; margin-left:0in">
        <span>&nbsp;- Max Payout setting is applied to all bet types of Sportsbook except the bet types listed in the table below. E-Sports and Muay Thai do not apply Max Payout setting.</span>
    </p>

    <table style="border-collapse:collapse; width:376pt; border:none" width="501">
        <tbody>
            <tr height="24" style="height:18.0pt">
                <td class="xl65" height="24" style="border:0.5pt solid #cecece; background:#666666 none repeat scroll 0% 0%; height:18.0pt; width:111pt; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; white-space:nowrap" width="148"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:white"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">Sports</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>
                <td class="xl65" style="border:0.5pt solid #cecece; background:#666666 none repeat scroll 0% 0%; border-left:none; width:265pt; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; white-space:nowrap" width="353"><span style="color:#ffffff;"><strong><span>Bet types that do not apply Max Payout setting</span></strong></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr height="24" style="height:18.0pt">
                <td class="xl67" height="192" rowspan="@betTypeNames.Length" style="border:0.5pt solid #cecece; background:#f3f5e0 none repeat scroll 0% 0%; height:144.0pt; border-top:none; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; white-space:nowrap">
                    <span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">All Sports except </span></span></span></span></span></span>
                    <br>
                    <span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">@sportTypeNames</span></span></span></span></span></span>
                </td>
                <td class="xl66" style="border:0.5pt solid #cecece; background:white none repeat scroll 0% 0%; border-top:none; border-left:none; padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; vertical-align:bottom; white-space:nowrap"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">@betTypeNames[0]</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>
            </tr>

            @{
                for (int i = 1; i < betTypeNames.Length; i++)
                {
                    <tr height="24" style="height:18.0pt">
                        <td class="xl66" height="24" style="border:0.5pt solid #cecece; background:white none repeat scroll 0% 0%; height:18.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; vertical-align:bottom; white-space:nowrap"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">@betTypeNames[i]</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>
                    </tr>
                }
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>
        <strong><span style="color: red;">The difference between</span> Parlay Max Payout and Parlay Max Payout Per Match</strong>
        <br>
        <span>&nbsp;- <strong>Parlay Max Payout:</strong> This setting is used to calculate the max bet of each combo parlay in a single ticket.</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For example,</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. Given that the Parlay Max Payout Setting is: Combo 2 = 500; Combo 3-5 = 1,000; Combo 6+ & System Parlay  = 2,000</span><br>
        <span>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. If member makes 3 selections: A (odds = 2), B (odds = 3), C (odds = 4), the system will offer the following combos: Double (3 Bets), Treble (1 Bet), Trixie (4 Bets) <br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; and Lucky 7 (7 Bets)
        </span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. Max Bet of 3 Double bets = Parlay Max Payout of Combo 2 / (odds AB + odds BC + odds AC) = 500 / (2*3 + 3*4 + 2*4) = 500 / 26 = 19</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. Max Bet of a Treble bet = Parlay Max Payout of Combo 3-5 / odds ABC = 1,000 / (2*3*4) = 1000 / 24 = 41</span><br>
        <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. Max Bet of Trixie and Lucky 7 bets =  Parlay Max Payout of Combo 6+ & System Parlay / (odds Double + odds Treble) = 2,000 / (26 + 24) = 2000 / 50 = 40</span><br>
        <br>
        <span>
            &nbsp;- <strong>Parlay Max Payout Per Match:</strong> The system accumulates the max payout of all running parlay tickets and uses it together with the setting value to calculate the next <br>
            &nbsp;ticket max bet. The max bet calculation is different between Single Match Parlay and Mix/Combo Parlay.
        </span><br>
        <br>
        <span>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; + Single Match Parlay: Max Bet = (Parlay Max Payout Per Match Setting - Accumulated Max Payout of the same match) / Odds  <br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * Single Match Parlay does not count Mix/Combo Parlay ticket
        </span><br>
        <br>
        <span>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; + Mix/Combo Parlay: Max Bet = (Parlay Max Payout Per Match Setting - Accumulated Max Payout of the all matches) / Odds <br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * Mix/Combo Parlay does not count Single Match Parlay tickets
        </span><br>
        <br>
        <span>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Accumulated max payout counts all running tickets. It will be released if any running tickets are settled/rejected/refunded/voided.
        </span><br>
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong><span style="color: red;">*</span> For parlay, Max Payout is applied to all bet types.</strong>
    </p>
</body>
</html>